     sa rasayatu mukundaH kundadAmAbhirAmaH || 38||
kalitamukhatAna lalitasukhagAna
     janitamatimoha vanitaratidoha |
chaladamalamAla jaladasamabhAla
     naya chaturashIla jaya madhuralIla || 39||
|| vIra ||
