bhAsurabhR^i~Nga kShmAdharashR^i~Nga
sthAtulasantastvAmabhajanta || 43||
|| nAtha ||
pANirme.atra madIyaki~NkiNisakhaH chokUyate tena kiM
     sadyaH sundari ki~NkiNImanu nijAM shAsha~NkamAnekShase |
jeghriye kamalaM vikAsya tava kiM chokupyate vA mukhaM
     sAkShAdityatima~njulA tava hare vANI vraje bhrAjatAm || 44||
atha chaNDavR^ittasya sAmAnyabhedaH
veNudhvAnaka dhenusvAnaka
sAraprItida sArashrImada |
dhAmashyAmala bhAmadhyAnala
